      "interpretation": "PFAS removal was quantified as the percentage decrease in aqueous PFAS concentration after 1 h batch contact with CAC BM in single-solute systems; higher removals were observed for long-chain PFAS (PFOS, PFOA) than for short-chain PFAS (PFBS, PFBA), consistent with stronger hydrophobic interactions and pore-filling for long-chain compounds.",
